      "split": "development",
      "task_id": "clamp-v1",
      "task": "实现 clamp(value, lower, upper)：整数上下限内返回 value，越界返回对应边界；lower>upper 时抛 ValueError。",
      "source": "def clamp(value, lower, upper):\n    return min(lower, max(value, upper))\n",
