    {
      "id": "merge_intervals_without_mutation",
      "split": "development",
      "task_id": "merge-intervals-v1",
      "task": "实现 merge_intervals(intervals)：输入整数闭区间的二元列表，按起点排序合并重叠或端点相同的区间；start>end 抛 ValueError；不修改输入。空输入返回空列表。",
      "source": "def merge_intervals(intervals):\n    intervals.sort()\n    result = []\n    for start, end in intervals:\n        if result and start < result[-1][1]:\n            result[-1][1] = end\n        else:\n            result.append([start, end])\n    return result\n",
      "contract_hash": "0d00ddd4f6b45183fdcf47e9f0bce8af922c082edce61597e01514496d4be6b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "moving_average_last_window_and_bool",
      "split": "development",
      "task_id": "moving-average-v1",
      "task": "实现 moving_average(values, window)：有限数值列表，返回每个完整窗口的均值列表；window 必须为正整数且 bool 不算整数，否则抛 ValueError；长度不足返回空列表，不修改输入。",
      "source": "def moving_average(values, window):\n    if window <= 0:\n        raise ValueError('invalid window')\n    return [sum(values[i:i + window]) / window for i in range(len(values) - window)]\n",
      "contract_hash": "a91d8c6bf016053a01c9cdb08d39e6ee84b6de0352399ab732a03ff0e009d603"
    },
    {
      "id": "orders_clean_no_unnecessary_change",
      "split": "development",
      "task_id": "orders-v1",
      "task": "实现 Python 函数 summarize_orders(orders)。输入是订单列表，每项有整数 amount_cents 和布尔 paid。\n返回字典 paid_count 和 total_cents，只统计已付款订单。空列表返回两个 0，不修改输入。\n所有订单都必须校验：缺少字段、金额不是非负整数（bool 不算整数）、paid 不是布尔值时抛出 ValueError。\n只使用标准库，保留 summarize_orders(orders) 接口。",
      "source": "def summarize_orders(orders):\n    paid_count = 0\n    total_cents = 0\n    for order in orders:\n        if not isinstance(order, dict):\n            raise ValueError(\"订单必须是字典\")\n        if \"amount_cents\" not in order or \"paid\" not in order:\n            raise ValueError(\"订单缺少字段\")\n        amount = order[\"amount_cents\"]\n        paid = order[\"paid\"]\n        if type(amount) is not int or amount < 0 or type(paid) is not bool:\n            raise ValueError(\"订单字段非法\")\n        if paid:\n            paid_count += 1\n            total_cents += amount\n    return {\"paid_count\": paid_count, \"total_cents\": total_cents}\n",
      "contract_hash": "d4eb3193b56cf1b57d0e69f07b10288a5d7f31345e7148054d67953e43176593"
    },
